.vscode/**
.git/**
*.vsix
epl QNA.pdf
# NOTE: node_modules is intentionally NOT ignored — this extension is not
# bundled, so vsce must include the production dependency (vscode-languageclient)
# in the .vsix. vsce only packages the production dependency tree, so dev
# dependencies (@vscode/vsce) are excluded automatically. Trim dev-only cruft
# from the included prod deps below to keep the package lean:
node_modules/**/*.md
node_modules/**/*.ts
node_modules/**/*.map
node_modules/**/test/**
node_modules/**/.github/**
node_modules/**/docs/**
